{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "03570",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.39,
      "end_seconds": 6.5,
      "duration_seconds": 5.11,
      "text": "Oh, good evening, doctor, thanks for seeing me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.27,
      "end_seconds": 13.18,
      "duration_seconds": 4.91,
      "text": "Not at all, please sit. What seems to be wrong?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 14.88,
      "end_seconds": 19.82,
      "duration_seconds": 4.94,
      "text": "So, I've been feeling tired and run down, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 21.45,
      "end_seconds": 25.03,
      "duration_seconds": 3.58,
      "text": "What do you take on a normal day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 26.15,
      "end_seconds": 29.55,
      "duration_seconds": 3.4,
      "text": "Escitalopram. I take it once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 31.16,
      "end_seconds": 33.63,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "So, do you know the dose?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 35.0,
      "end_seconds": 36.59,
      "duration_seconds": 1.59,
      "text": "It's 10 milligrams."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 41.32,
      "end_seconds": 44.51,
      "duration_seconds": 3.19,
      "text": "How many days or weeks has it been?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 46.01,
      "end_seconds": 50.13,
      "duration_seconds": 4.12,
      "text": "It's been about four days, I'm fairly sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 51.36,
      "end_seconds": 54.08,
      "duration_seconds": 2.72,
      "text": "Is it bearing on you a lot?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 55.73,
      "end_seconds": 57.34,
      "duration_seconds": 1.61,
      "text": "Severe, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 58.16,
      "end_seconds": 60.61,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "Does anything else come with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 61.16,
      "end_seconds": 77.85,
      "duration_seconds": 16.69,
      "text": "Night sweats goes along with it, um, most of the time. Ah, with night sweats, it just comes and goes. Oh, and back pain that doesn't go away. Had that since Monday."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 79.68,
      "end_seconds": 81.74,
      "duration_seconds": 2.06,
      "text": "How frequently does it come?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 83.41,
      "end_seconds": 85.83,
      "duration_seconds": 2.42,
      "text": "Honestly, on and off."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 101.32,
      "end_seconds": 104.95,
      "duration_seconds": 3.63,
      "text": "Have you noticed high fever or chest pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 106.02,
      "end_seconds": 112.67,
      "duration_seconds": 6.65,
      "text": "Hmm, you know, I haven't had high fever or chest pain, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 113.85,
      "end_seconds": 117.14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.29,
      "text": "Did you get breathlessness or leg weakness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 118.4,
      "end_seconds": 122.24,
      "duration_seconds": 3.84,
      "text": "No, you know, none that I've noticed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 122.75,
      "end_seconds": 124.96,
      "duration_seconds": 2.21,
      "text": "Is your chest okay generally?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 129.91,
      "end_seconds": 132.83,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "No, my breathing's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 150.55,
      "end_seconds": 156.39,
      "duration_seconds": 5.84,
      "text": "Do you have any long-term conditions? These questions might sound routine, but they matter."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 158.2,
      "end_seconds": 161.34,
      "duration_seconds": 3.14,
      "text": "So, I've had depression, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 163.34,
      "end_seconds": 170.89,
      "duration_seconds": 7.55,
      "text": "Right, so depression is already on your record. We'll keep that in mind today. Anything surgical in your history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 172.62,
      "end_seconds": 179.93,
      "duration_seconds": 7.31,
      "text": "Yes, I had a cataract operation in my left eye, about a year ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 181.34,
      "end_seconds": 184.19,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "Does your family have any medical conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 185.98,
      "end_seconds": 188.61,
      "duration_seconds": 2.63,
      "text": "My uncle has high cholesterol."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 189.24,
      "end_seconds": 192.2,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "Alright, now some background about your lifestyle."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 194.13,
      "end_seconds": 210.02,
      "duration_seconds": 15.89,
      "text": "I used to drink heavily but I stopped four years ago. I smoke roughly a pack every two days. I work in accounts at a hospital. My partner and our baby."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 210.78,
      "end_seconds": 215.29,
      "duration_seconds": 4.51,
      "text": "Are you allergic to anything? Any allergies to medicines or foods?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 218.59,
      "end_seconds": 221.69,
      "duration_seconds": 3.1,
      "text": "Well, no allergies at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 231.78,
      "end_seconds": 235.28,
      "duration_seconds": 3.5,
      "text": "Let me get the readings out of the way."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 245.99,
      "end_seconds": 248.94,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "That's it, just a little longer..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 260.28,
      "end_seconds": 269.63,
      "duration_seconds": 9.35,
      "text": "Okay: saturation 95 percent, respiratory rate 20, BP is 105 over 75. And pulse 107, temp 38.5 degrees."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 272.16,
      "end_seconds": 273.85,
      "duration_seconds": 1.69,
      "text": "Is that okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 274.9,
      "end_seconds": 278.79,
      "duration_seconds": 3.89,
      "text": "Don't worry, we'll discuss it in a second."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 281.44,
      "end_seconds": 285.12,
      "duration_seconds": 3.68,
      "text": "Let me look at the area, I'll be gentle."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 286.7,
      "end_seconds": 288.62,
      "duration_seconds": 1.92,
      "text": "Let me feel here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 304.43,
      "end_seconds": 311.81,
      "duration_seconds": 7.38,
      "text": "There is a soft heart murmur you've not had before and a small tender spot on the fingertip."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 315.98,
      "end_seconds": 333.81,
      "duration_seconds": 17.83,
      "text": "Right, that's all I needed to check. Okay, thinking it through, I'd lean towards possible infection of the heart valve causing back and general symptoms. The reason I say that is that your story and my examination fit together. Another possibility is a muscle strain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 334.9,
      "end_seconds": 338.08,
      "duration_seconds": 3.18,
      "text": "Is there something to worry about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 338.79,
      "end_seconds": 367.9,
      "duration_seconds": 29.11,
      "text": "It's reasonable to be concerned, but right now possible infection of the heart valve causing back and general symptoms is my leading thought, not anything worse. I'm going to order an echocardiogram, for new murmur. This is not an ordinary back strain, so I want tests today. The medical admissions unit would be the right next step, I'll refer you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 369.02,
      "end_seconds": 378.9,
      "duration_seconds": 9.88,
      "text": "Alright, uh, thank you. Do I need an MRI of the spine? I read it might help."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 379.67,
      "end_seconds": 390.38,
      "duration_seconds": 10.71,
      "text": "I don't think that's needed at this stage, the history doesn't call for it. Come back straight away. That's all from me. Any questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 391.46,
      "end_seconds": 393.9,
      "duration_seconds": 2.44,
      "text": "Thank you, doctor, goodbye."
    }
  ]
}